# Public `include/` is tracked

Forge mod-sync is **gone**. Product headers under `include/pymergetic/metal/`
are the **hand-maintained public face** (see [`docs/HYBRID.md`](../../docs/HYBRID.md)
and [`include/README.md`](../../include/README.md)).

**Do not** add a root `.gitignore` line `/include/`.

Hybrid impls live under `src/pymergetic/metal/<mod>/` (`__init__.{c,rs,pyi}`).
Product code `#include`s only `include/` paths.
